  "applies_to": "TROX TROX UNIVERSAL controllers set up as room airflow controller, master, fitted with the EM-BAC-MOD-01 expansion module.",
  "summary": "TROX UNIVERSAL lab and room airflow controllers connect to BACnet MS/TP (or Modbus RTU) through the EM-BAC-MOD-01 expansion module. This is TROX's EDE file for the room airflow controller, master (order code RS/M / RE/M): 48 value objects (17 AV, 27 BV, 4 MV). The MS/TP module has a much smaller object set than the EM-IP (BACnet IP) module, and some instance numbers differ.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "EM-BAC-MOD EDE V4.1",
  "default_device_instance": "32900 + network address",
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "The module holds the objects of all applications; objects outside this application stay unused.",
    "Units come from the EDE unit-code column; airflows are in l/s.",
    "The EDE prints Setpoint1/Setpoint2 as the state text of BV 4 ManOP_Disable; the states shown here are the 0/1 meanings from the EM-BAC-MOD-01 manual.",
    "MV 1 COVU-Mode (MS/TP module only) sets how unsolicited COV notifications go out: 1 none, 2 local MS/TP broadcast, 3 global broadcast."
  ],
